  "thought": "Audited the previous SQL against the question, schema notes, and the returned rows. (1) Partition pruning: order facts use ds BETWEEN '20261001' AND '20261012', refunds ds BETWEEN '20261001' AND '20261015', dimension is unpartitioned and not filtered by ds — correct, no MAX_PT misuse. (2) Grain/fanout: order fact is at order_item grain, and order_agg pre-aggregates SUM(pay_amt) to order level keyed by (order_id, shop_id) before any join; refund_dedup dedupes by refund_id over partitions and refund_agg sums approved refunds to order level before the LEFT JOIN on order_id only, so there is no order x item or order x refund multiplication. (3) Status filters: only order_status <> 'cancelled' and refund_status = 'approved' are applied, matching the probed enums; no extra lifecycle/channel predicates and no IS NOT NULL on dimensions. (4) Units: pay_amt and refund_amt are DOUBLE in yuan (no /100), comm_rate_bps is basis points converted exactly once with /10000.0 — correct; the implied blended rates (CORE ~575bps, STD ~614bps, KA ~696bps) are within the probed 300–1250bps band and consistent with per-shop rate variance inside a tier, i.e. no cent/bps mis-scaling. (5) SCD2: eff_end_dt is normalized (NULL/'' -> '9999-12-31'), intervals are matched to the order pay date derived as SUBSTR(pay_ts,1,10) ('YYYY-MM-DD' vs 'YYYY-MM-DD' string comparison, uniform format), is_current is deliberately NOT used as the selector, and two-stage dedup (interval-level then per order/pay_date) guarantees exactly one tier+rate per order, so no fanout or wrong-version pick when tiers change mid-window. (6) LEFT JOIN refund_agg preserves orders with no refunds and COALESCE gives refund_yuan=0; right-table filter sits inside the refund CTE, not in the outer WHERE. (7) Net commission is computed at order level as (order gross pay - order approved refund) * that order's effective rate and then summed per tier, which is the exact semantics of '(订单实付 - 已批准退款) * 生效费率' (a tier-level multiplication by a single blended rate would be wrong). (8) Output has the required four columns, ROUND(...,2) on all three monetary metrics, GROUP BY contract_tier and ORDER BY contract_tier ASC; three rows (CORE/KA/STD) returned with plausible magnitudes and trailing-zero-free doubles (60007.5 is numerically 60007.50). No silent caliber trap found.",
  "diagnosis": "No defect found: the query passed gateway/execution and the sanity audit confirms correct partition pruning, order/sub-order grain pre-aggregation, refund ticket dedup, approved-only refund filter, pay-date-aligned SCD2 tier/rate resolution (ignoring is_current), single bps->rate conversion, LEFT JOIN preservation of refund-free orders, and order-level net commission aggregation. Output columns, rounding and tier ordering match the business hint.",
  "sql": "WITH order_agg AS (SELECT order_id, shop_id, MAX(SUBSTR(pay_ts,1,10)) AS pay_date, SUM(pay_amt) AS gross_pay_yuan FROM dwd_trade_order_di WHERE ds BETWEEN '20261001' AND '20261012' AND order_status <> 'cancelled' GROUP BY order_id, shop_id), dim_norm AS (SELECT shop_id, contract_tier, comm_rate_bps, eff_start_dt, CASE WHEN eff_end_dt IS NULL OR eff_end_dt = '' THEN '9999-12-31' ELSE eff_end_dt END AS eff_end_dt, is_current, comm_scd_id FROM dim_shop_commission_scd2), dim_dedup AS (SELECT shop_id, contract_tier, comm_rate_bps, eff_start_dt, eff_end_dt, is_current, comm_scd_id FROM (SELECT shop_id, contract_tier, comm_rate_bps, eff_start_dt, eff_end_dt, is_current, comm_scd_id, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY shop_id, eff_start_dt, eff_end_dt ORDER BY is_current DESC, comm_scd_id DESC) AS rn FROM dim_norm) t WHERE rn = 1), order_tier_ranked AS (SELECT o.order_id, o.shop_id, o.pay_date, o.gross_pay_yuan, c.contract_tier, c.comm_rate_bps, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY o.order_id, o.shop_id, o.pay_date ORDER BY c.is_current DESC, c.eff_start_dt DESC, c.comm_scd_id DESC) AS rn FROM order_agg o JOIN dim_dedup c ON c.shop_id = o.shop_id AND o.pay_date BETWEEN c.eff_start_dt AND c.eff_end_dt), order_tier AS (SELECT order_id, shop_id, pay_date, gross_pay_yuan, contract_tier, comm_rate_bps FROM order_tier_ranked WHERE rn = 1), refund_dedup AS (SELECT refund_id, order_id, refund_amt, ds, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY refund_id ORDER BY ds DESC) AS rn FROM dwd_refund_di WHERE ds BETWEEN '20261001' AND '20261015' AND refund_status = 'approved'), refund_agg AS (SELECT order_id, SUM(refund_amt) AS refund_yuan FROM refund_dedup WHERE rn = 1 GROUP BY order_id), order_net AS (SELECT t.contract_tier, t.order_id, t.shop_id, t.gross_pay_yuan, COALESCE(r.refund_yuan, 0) AS refund_yuan, (t.gross_pay_yuan - COALESCE(r.refund_yuan, 0)) * t.comm_rate_bps / 10000.0 AS net_comm_yuan FROM order_tier t LEFT JOIN refund_agg r ON t.order_id = r.order_id) SELECT contract_tier, ROUND(SUM(gross_pay_yuan), 2) AS gross_pay_yuan, ROUND(SUM(refund_yuan), 2) AS refund_yuan, ROUND(SUM(net_comm_yuan), 2) AS net_comm_yuan FROM order_net GROUP BY contract_tier ORDER BY contract_tier ASC"
}

